#: debugger/variable/variablewidget.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<b>Variable tree</b>"
"<p>The variable tree allows you to see the values of local variables and "
"arbitrary expressions.</p>"
"<p>Local variables are displayed automatically and are updated as you step "
"through your program. For each expression you enter, you can either evaluate "
"it once, or \"watch\" it (make it auto-updated). Expressions that are not "
"auto-updated can be updated manually from the context menu. Expressions can "
"be renamed to more descriptive names by clicking on the name column.</p>"
"<p>To change the value of a variable or an expression, click on the value.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""

